	<string>Sundial shows the events of the calendars you choose on its dials: long events around the year and today's events around the day. Events are only read, never changed, and never leave your device.</string>
	<key>NSCalendarsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Sundial shows the events of the calendars you choose on its dials: long events around the year and today's events around the day. Events are only read, never changed, and never leave your device.</string>
